sort [g asc, r asc, id asc]
└─ project (g, f, id, r)
   └─ project (x.g, x.f, x.id, x.r)
      └─ filter (> 3 w_0)
         └─ window partition=[big.g] order=[big.f asc] fns=[w_0=rank]
            └─ filter (> 3 __topk_0__)
               └─ window partial partition=[big.g] order=[big.f asc] fns=[__topk_0__=rank]
                  └─ source big AS big (rows≈400 cost≈9.6K)
